                              "name": "botText1",
                              "fill": "$A:--foreground",
                              "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                              "width": 240,
                              "content": "This is a Semi Detached (Half Duplex) located at 213 25 Avenue NE in Calgary's Tuxedo Park neighbourhood. The home features 3+1 bedrooms across the upper and lower levels, 3 bathrooms, and no enclosed garage. The lot is mid-block facing north, with mature landscaping and a fenced backyard. Interior highlights include a renovated kitchen with quartz counters, hardwood flooring through the main level, and a finished basement that adds extra living area suitable as a fourth bedroom or family room. The roof was replaced in 2021 and the furnace is reported to be from 2019, making major systems relatively recent. The neighbourhood is known for tree-lined streets and walkability to local shops, transit, and parks along the Bow River pathway.",
